              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "pc-1-s",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Our parent community plays an essential role in enriching campus life: they serve on advisory committees, mentor student clubs, support fundraising efforts, and assist in organizing cultural and academic events. Their hands-on involvement not only strengthens the bond between home and school but also provides students with real-world role models and a broader network of support."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            },
            {
              "_key": "pc-2",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "pc-2-s",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "We are proud to see our parent community become partners in learning. By working together, we ensure that every student feels supported both in and out of the classroom and that our campus truly operates as an extended family dedicated to shaping tomorrow’s leaders."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
